01:21:13.200 --> 01:21:17.520
the built environment and the design of public spaces.

01:21:18.020 --> 01:21:20.744
And whereas the Ontario Building Code establishes only a minimum level of accessibility for buildings

01:21:21.244 --> 01:21:24.520
and therefore does not presently meet the accessibility needs of all people.

01:21:25.020 --> 01:21:28.760
And whereas accessibility in the built environment should be improved by integrating standards

01:21:29.260 --> 01:21:32.790
into the code and

01:21:33.290 --> 01:21:37.230
promote meaningful access of buildings and sites for people with a range

01:21:37.730 --> 01:21:41.630
